# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Spectra Systems — environment
#  Everything runs fully offline with ZERO configuration.
#  Single-service by default: the canvas runs the Compiler Engine
#  in-process. The variables below are all optional.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Optional: open-ended generation via Anthropic ──
# Leave SPECTRA_LLM unset (or "deterministic") to run the offline,
# zero-key deterministic compiler. Set to "anthropic" AND provide a
# key to unlock LLM generation. Generated code still passes the full
# validate → compile → repair guarantee loop before it can mount.
# SPECTRA_LLM=anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# ── Optional: two-service topology ──
# Set COMPILER_URL to make the canvas proxy to a standalone Fastify
# Compiler Engine instead of running it in-process. Then run the
# compiler separately:  pnpm --filter @spectra/compiler start
# COMPILER_URL=http://localhost:4000

# Standalone Fastify compiler listen port (only used in two-service mode).
# PORT=4000
